    "habitat": "mesopelagic",
    "order": 53,
    "notes": "Soft, gelatinous dark red-black body ~30 cm long with one pair of ear-like fins on the rear mantle, very large blue-glinting eyes, eight arms joined by a black web (cloak) lined with fleshy cirri, and two long retractile sticky filaments. Light organs: a large lidded photophore at the base of each fin and a light organ at the tip of every arm (blue light, also a glowing mucus cloud). The squid template has no web: the arms are wide, splayed and dark to read as a cloak."
